# Go vendored FFI artifacts
packages/go/include/*
!packages/go/include/ts_pack.h
# Staging dir written by `task go:vendor` / `go run ./cmd/setup`. The leading dot
# matters — the old `packages/go/lib/` rule matched nothing and let 203 MB of
# compiled archives get committed. ~keep
packages/go/.lib/
# Compiled output of `go build ./cmd/setup`, which lands beside the source it was
# built from. Anchored so it cannot match the cmd/setup source directory. ~keep
/packages/go/setup

# Compiled object files and static archives are always build output
*.a
*.o

# Elixir build artifacts
crates/ts-pack-elixir/deps/
crates/ts-pack-elixir/_build/

# Ruby
crates/ts-pack-ruby/tmp/
packages/ruby/tmp/

# Parsers (cloned at build time)
parsers/

# Generated parser artifacts for in-repo (vendored) grammars — regenerated from grammar.js.
# Hand-written external scanners (scanner.c/scanner.cc) are source, not generated, so they
# stay tracked; only the generated outputs are ignored.
grammars/*/src/parser.c
grammars/*/src/grammar.json
grammars/*/src/node-types.json
grammars/*/src/tree_sitter/

